---
---

<section class="relative py-14 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Floating Parallax Circle -->
  <div
    data-parallax-speed="-1.4"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 right-12 h-28 w-28 rounded-full bg-[#EBEAFB] opacity-80"
  ></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <!-- Big Impact Metric Banner -->
    <div
      data-dr-anim="scale-y"
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[#5956E9] px-6 py-12 sm:px-12 lg:py-16 text-white shadow-drnube"
    >
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-[#FAB8C4]/20 blur-2xl"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
          <span
            data-dr-anim="scale-y"
            class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/15 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FFDC60]"
          >
            Digitalización Real para tu Negocio
          </span>
          <h2
            data-dr-anim="scale-y"
            data-dr-delay="100"
            class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px]"
          >
            Tus clientes ya eligen, compran y reservan desde el celular.
          </h2>
          <p
            data-dr-anim="scale-y"
            data-dr-delay="150"
            class="text-lg text-[#EBEAFB] max-w-xl font-medium"
          >
            Te ayudamos a dar el salto digital con soluciones listas que empiezan a generar resultados en menos de 48 horas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div
            data-dr-anim="translate-y"
            data-dr-delay="100"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 border border-white/15"
          >
            <p
              data-count-to="80"
              data-count-prefix="+"
              data-count-suffix="%"
              class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#FFDC60]"
            >
              +80%
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-white">Prefiere comprar online</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#EBEAFB]">Al negocio que responde al instante</p>
          </div>
          <div
            data-dr-anim="translate-y"
            data-dr-delay="200"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 border border-white/15"
          >
            <p
              data-count-to="48"
              data-count-suffix="hs"
              class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white"
            >
              48hs
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-white">Tu web funcionando</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#EBEAFB]">Llave en mano con tu dominio</p>
          </div>
          <div
            data-dr-anim="translate-y"
            data-dr-delay="300"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 border border-white/15"
          >
            <p
              data-count-to="24"
              data-count-suffix="/7"
              class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#FAB8C4]"
            >
              24/7
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-white">Ventas y cobranzas</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#EBEAFB]">Incluso feriados y de noche</p>
          </div>
          <div
            data-dr-anim="translate-y"
            data-dr-delay="400"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 border border-white/15"
          >
            <p
              data-count-to="100"
              data-count-suffix="%"
              class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-emerald-300"
            >
              100%
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-white">Sin complicaciones</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#EBEAFB]">Soporte directo por WhatsApp</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
